  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO program (Junior Professional Officers) are an important part of   the total Swedish focus on increased Swedish participation in         international organizations. The program offers young graduates the   opportunity to serve in the UN and other international organizations</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tj&#xe4;nsten &#xe4;r vald i samr&#xe5;d mellan Sida UNDP/UNWomen. Insatsen f&#xf6;ljs upp genom fastst&#xe4;llda mekanismer hos b&#xe5;de UNDP/UNWomen och Sida. Kandidaten har valts i konkurrens. Sida f&#xf6;rbereder kandidaten f&#xf6;r sin tj&#xe4;nst innan utresa genom utbildning och spr&#xe5;kkurs.</narrative>
  </description>
